      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 57 Wilford Court, Bray, Co. Dublin to the market a stunning three bedroom, three bathroom own door duplex apartment ideally located within this mature and highly convenient development. Wilford Court enjoys an enviable position close to Bray Town Centre with a fantastic array of amenities nearby including cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, boutiques and leisure facilities. Bray Seafront and promenade are just a short distance away, offering beautiful coastal walks and a vibrant atmosphere. The area also benefits from excellent transport links with Bray DART Station and numerous Dublin Bus routes easily accessible, while the N11 and M50 road networks provide swift access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to c. 115sqm, and comprises of private own door entrance, entrance hallway, generous living room, fully fitted kitchen and guest bathroom on the main level, while upstairs hosts three well-proportioned bedrooms including master ensuite and main family bathroom. The property benefits from a practical duplex layout with excellent natural light throughout. The home further benefits from a sunny private balcony. \r\n\r\nNo. 57 is sure to appeal to first time buyers, investors and growing families alike seeking a spacious and well-located property in the heart of Bray. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n• c. 115 sqm\r\n• BER B1\r\n• 3 Bed / 3 Bath\r\n• Own door duplex\r\n• Management fees c. 2,830\r\n• Parking \r\n• Gas heating\r\n• Double glazed windows\r\n• Fully fitted kitchen\r\n• Sunny private balcony \r\n• A short stroll to the beach \r\n• Bright and airy\r\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout \r\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\r\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance \r\n• No onwards chain\r\n• Highly sought after location \r\n• Ideal for first time buyers and growing families\r\n• Viewing highly advised!\r\n\r\nMeasurements;\r\nEntrance Hallway: 1.68m X 6.37m. \r\nLiving Room: 4.86m X 5.03m. \r\nKitchen: 3.08m X 2.58m. \r\nDining Area: 3.43m X 2.80m.\r\nBedroom 1: 4.86m X 4.20m. \r\nBedroom 2: 2.45m X 5.04m. \r\nBedroom 3: 2.31m X 4.14m. \r\nBathroom: 2.75m X 2.21m. \r\nW/C: 1.86m X 1.55m. \r\nEn-suite: 2.75m X 1.08m. \r\n\r\nDirections;\r\nEircode: A98 AR41"
      },
